Name":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/10/11/president-trump-declares-energy-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T15:40:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"jppy6nj6ikhkaic9xq4po677c"}],"citationId":"gmhlyofyrsb7w5yjzvl0q3iio"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"各方敦促美国最高法院审理体育预测市场监管争议","summary":"多方上周向美国最高法院提交法庭之友简报，敦促其审理体育类预测市场合约是否属于掉期的问题，多数意见支持由各州而非CFTC监管。该案已出现联邦巡回法院分歧，CFTC周五提出两项规则方案，拟将体育、政治、文化和天气事件纳入属于掉期的事件合约，同时排除赌场式赌博。Kalshi获准延长提交回应的期限，截止日为2026年11月9日。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/11/everyone-wants-scotus-to-take-up-prediction-markets-state-of-crypto","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T18:30:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"uhkykyn4n6ld09seejm4bvp5m"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"房地产新政从细则发布进入土拍规则落地阶段","summary":"北京、上海、广州和武汉已出台房地产新政实施意见，要求新出让土地项目优先现售，并细化预售条件、资金监管、主办银行和土地款支付安排。泉州、汕头、嘉峪关、济源等地部分住宅用地已将现房销售或项目公司制、主办银行制写入出让条件。文章称，地方还需协调土地出让文件、规划条件和合同模板，房企拿地与项目分期开发将面临现金流安排和执行磨合。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1011/1060570.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T03:20:20.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"jujte7k5oxmkggj3ppktjw1ia"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"四部门拟加强汽车创新设计验证管理，新增51项参数并设3万公里门槛","summary":"工业和信息化部等四部门发布汽车产品创新设计和研发测试验证管理通知征求意见稿，拟自2027年1月1日起对涉及创新设计的新申报产品新增51项技术参数要求。征求意见稿要求完成不少于30000公里可靠性验证，以及不少于1年的“两冬一夏”环境适应性验证，并将维修经济性和规范营销宣传纳入汽车准入管理。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://auto.eastmoney.com/news/11262,202610113892122727.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T16:14:55.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"tfbjwi1f6tnwf8bgmpspwi8d0"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"英格兰银行拟为英镑稳定币提供央行支持并设40 billion英镑发行上限","summary":"英格兰银行表示将成为稳定币的“银行家”，并在6月22日的政策声明中调整英镑稳定币监管框架。每种稳定币暂设£40 billion发行上限，储备中可配置短期英国政府债务的比例从60%提高至70%，其余30%可存放于央行。完整框架计划于2026年底前实施，相关稳定币业务预计从2027年开始。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/bank-of-england-banker-to-stablecoin/","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T12:34:31.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"wvicrfe4a252adtenkgog6s20"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"NVIDIA表外承诺升至5300亿美元，SemiAnalysis称未来或超1万亿美元","summary":"NVIDIA最新10-Q显示，其表外担保总额升至5300亿美元，较上一季度的1840亿美元增加超过180%。SemiAnalysis称，新增承诺包括360亿美元AI云服务协议和200亿美元数据中心租约，并预计NVIDIA截至2028年1月的财年EBITDA将达4500亿美元。该机构认为表外义务理论上可能扩张至1万亿美元以上，但这不是盈利预测，行业下行时的履约能力仍是核心风险。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783383","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T10:56:33.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"fg3zesqikgpoq2i2znjwpxafh"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"哈药股份总裁芦传有被立案并留置，公司称生产经营正常","summary":"10月11日，哈药股份公告称，公司董事兼总裁芦传有近日收到相关监察委员会的《立案通知书》和《留置通知书》，公司已对相关工作作出安排，董事会运作及生产经营正常。公司2026年上半年实现营业收入82.96亿元，同比增长2.10%；归属于上市公司股东的净利润为4.10亿元，同比增长57.99%。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202610113892084774.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T16:06:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ajpsjvtsk6c5sregteuaoj7eu"}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"SEC起诉Linqto创始人及前高管涉嫌欺诈散户投资者","summary":"SEC起诉Linqto创始人 William Sarris 和前高管 Joseph Endoso，指控其在至少 2021 年至 2024 年间误导并欺诈散户投资者。Linqto 子公司向散户出售了价值超过 4.3 亿美元的SPV份额，SEC称相关人员虚假宣传定价、认购状态和算法定价机制，并非法运营未注册投资公司及向非合格投资者出售证券。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a12859-aebf-766b-82f1-a65cfcd2a361","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kbd96ik2tl5j5rtttf6lhxf0p"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"利雅得国际机场遭袭致至少12人死亡，沙特与胡塞武装冲突升级","summary":"彭博报道称，利雅得国际机场遭袭，至少12人死亡、300多人受伤，沙特阿拉伯与受伊朗支持的也门胡塞武装之间的战斗进一步升级。Bloomberg Middle East记者Dan Williams还讨论了美国军事介入的可能性、沙特投资计划面临的威胁，以及伊朗重建导弹库存的努力。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-11/saudi-airport-attack-kills-12-as-conflict-escalates-video","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T13:46:58.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":