l,"title":"IMF研究发现代币化股票存在需求，但市场仍波动且缺乏流动性","summary":"IMF一项研究发现，代币化美国股票的交易中超过一半发生在常规市场时段之外，约80%的交易少于一股，显示投资者重视全天候交易和低门槛持有。代币化股票隔夜价格变动中超过85%会在美国市场开盘后5分钟内反映到传统股票，且其波动率约为传统市场对应股票的1.5倍、流动性明显较低。IMF称代币化市场仍规模小且分散，需要完善所有权、流动性、系统互操作性和结算安排。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/11/imf-finds-demand-for-tokenized-stocks-says-the-market-is-still-volatile-illiquid","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T13:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"hw9dzgnd0ql906x7drhzsw92z"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Ledger硬件钱包事件攻击者将745万美元ETH转入Tornado Cash","summary":"与CryptoBilis Ledger硬件钱包事件相关的攻击者在10月9日至10日期间向Tornado Cash存入2990.3枚ETH，价值约745万美元。攻击者此前将资金分散至14个地址，并通过NEAR Intents跨链转换至ZEC网络进行隐私处理，但部分地址和Gas支付钱包存在关联迹象。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a12a79-5c9f-77e7-99d5-69d8f497cd18","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T10:19:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ndype2hkum1qh1vmpnjwr7gqv"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国 AI 算力租赁有多贵：现货价格是长协的 2 倍、云厂商回报门槛的 4 倍","summary":"美国 AI 算力租赁呈现短期现货昂贵、长期合同便宜的倒挂结构，一吉瓦算力年化收入约为现货400亿至500亿美元、长期合同200亿至300亿美元，而超大规模云厂商自建产能的回报门槛约为120亿美元。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783358","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T03:30:36.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"i8fe8gy193cy7tqoxnsk6whzf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"证监会优化浮动费率公募基金注册安排，中小公募可参与且存量产品可改造","summary":"证监会最新机构监管通报提出扩大新模式浮动费率公募基金参与机构范围，支持中型和中小基金管理人布局相关产品，并允许部分存量固定费率产品稳妥改造。截至2026年6月底，新模式浮费产品规模从首批募集的259亿元增至1373亿元；截至10月10日，共有173只浮动费率产品成立。通报还支持开发主动量化、港股主题等偏股型产品。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15176176.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T03:10:11.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ktsku57xbb4zt5lkwv4m4njp3"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"人社部发布新就业形态劳动者权益保障办法征求意见稿","summary":"人社部发布《新就业形态劳动者权益保障办法（征求意见稿）》，拟将依托互联网平台、按照平台劳动规则提供劳动并获取报酬的劳动者纳入保障范围。征求意见稿提出合理确定日、周最长工作时间，要求平台建立工时台账并允许劳动者查询，但对在线等单是否计入工时、正常劳动如何界定及跨平台工时如何合并计算仍未明确。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1011/1061138.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T13:13:14.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"w65ke1oeatoiidvq7r0rdbqr4"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国司法部调查电视网络暂停特朗普报道是否违反反垄断法","summary":"美国司法部启动调查，审查由 CNN、Fox News、ABC、CBS 和 NBC 等组成的白宫电视新闻池暂时停止报道特朗普是否违反《谢尔曼法》。调查源于白宫限制 CNN、MS NOW 和 Politico 记者进入白宫后的报道暂停；相关电视池报道目前已恢复，特朗普政府仍面临这些媒体提起的诉讼。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/11/trump-doj-white-house-tv-press-pool-antitrust.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T20:18:38.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"fn2976ijfx4m1s922ajgf56x7"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/47b27ccea2f9260b781ea31db02a26e2e28382a33fdb3006fd6110d8289ddc65.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Manus恢复独立运营后获超5亿美元融资，AI智能体竞争加剧","summary":"Manus母公司蝴蝶效应宣布完成超5亿美元融资，由博裕投资、IDG资本领投，腾讯、红杉中国和真格基金继续参与，市场传闻目标估值约40亿美元。文章回顾了Manus与Meta交易被叫停并恢复独立运营的过程，并梳理其推出Manus 2.0和个人Agent应用Cue后面临的国内外竞争。","sourceName":"钛媒体","sourceUrl":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8163955.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T13:07:50.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"bbr3nbb1b8ireyqq91zryx59o"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"未修补 LDK 的 Lightning 应用面临重连欺骗导致的 Bitcoin 被盗风险","summary":"LDK 修复了一项重连漏洞，恶意通道对手可在重新连接后谎称未收到更新，诱使应用签署冲突承诺交易，从而让转发节点损失 Bitcoin。v0.2.7 和 v0.1.13 分别修复 0.2 与 0.1 分支的漏洞；v0.2.7 还修复了 LSPS2 即时支付中的金额校验问题，开发者需将修复后的库代码纳入已部署软件，并处理旧版本排队的未校验支付合约。","sourceName":"CryptoSlate","sourceUrl":"https://cryptoslate.com/unpatched-ldk-apps-can-lose-bitcoin-when-a-lightning-peer-lies-after-reconnecting/","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T18:00:02.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"bwxh6ra3f90f9yfi4wfsyohak"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高盛模型测算9月布伦特原油风险溢价达每桶22美元","summary":"高盛纳入非OECD全球陆上库存后测算，9月布伦特原油平均风险溢价为每桶22美元，为有记录以来第二高，仅次于2026年4月。自3月以来，全球石油库存已消耗约6.6亿桶，其中近60%来自非OECD国家；作为对比，2022年俄乌冲突后的月度风险溢价峰值未超过每桶16美元。高盛维持风险溢价逐步回归零的基准情景，同时警告地缘政治风险若持续，油价预测存在上行风险。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783356","publishedAt":"2026-10-11T02:49:25.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"rmlx82s6oei6vrh4y8r471j47"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":10,"firstPartyEvents":6},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-11","next":"2026-10-13"}